  IconPath: icons/equipment/wrist/bracer-engraved-leather-black.webp
  Description: "Usage worn anklets, bracers, or circlet (often a headband) These
    weighted bands don't enhance your power\u2014rather, they keep your strength
    in check, honing your discipline. Immanence The bands of imprisonment tighten,
    keeping your mind sharp. You gain a +1 status bonus to Will saving throws and
    resistance to mental damage equal to half your level. Transcendence\u2014 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Break
